# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# fulldaygo.smarterbot.cl — Environment Variables
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copia este archivo a .env.local y completa los valores
# IMPORTANTE: .env.local está en .gitignore — nunca commitees secrets
# Ver README-VAULT-MCP.md para la guía completa de setup

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🔐 Authentication (Clerk)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Obtén tus claves en https://dashboard.clerk.com

NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_XXXXXXXXX
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_XXXXXXXXX
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_IN_URL=/sign-in
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_UP_URL=/sign-up
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_AFTER_SIGN_IN_URL=/dashboard
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_AFTER_SIGN_UP_URL=/dashboard
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_AFTER_SIGN_IN_URL=/dashboard
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_AFTER_SIGN_UP_URL=/dashboard

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🗄️ Database (Supabase)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Obtén tus claves en https://app.supabase.com/project/_/settings/api

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxxxxxxxxxxxx
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🔐 Vault Integration (HashiCorp Vault)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ver README-VAULT-MCP.md para generar estos tokens

VAULT_ADDR=https://vault.smarterbot.cl
VAULT_TOKEN=hvs.CAESIxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
VAULT_NAMESPACE=smarteros

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🤖 MCP Server (SmarterMCP)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ver smarteros-specs/mcp/smartermcp.yml para detalles

SMARTERMCP_ENDPOINT=https://mcp.smarterbot.cl
SMARTERMCP_API_TOKEN=smcp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
SMARTERMCP_TENANT_ID=fulldaygo

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ☁️ Azure Container Apps (opcional)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

AZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
AZURE_TENANT_ID=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
AZURE_CLIENT_ID=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 📧 Email (Mailgun, opcional)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

MAILGUN_API_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
MAILGUN_DOMAIN=mg.smarterbot.cl

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 💬 Communication (opcional)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Chatwoot (live chat)
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHATWOOT_WEBSITE_TOKEN=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
CHATWOOT_BASE_URL=https://app.chatwoot.com

# Slack (notificaciones)
SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=xoxb-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# WhatsApp Business API
WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 📊 Analytics & Monitoring (opcional)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

NEXT_PUBLIC_VERCEL_ANALYTICS_ID=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=phc_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://app.posthog.com
SENTRY_DSN=https://xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx@sentry.io/xxxxx
NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=https://xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx@sentry.io/xxxxx

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🚀 Deployment
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

NODE_ENV=production
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://fulldaygo.smarterbot.cl

# Chatwoot Integration
CHATWOOT_BASE_URL=https://chatwoot.smarterbot.cl
CHATWOOT_ACCOUNT_ID=1
CHATWOOT_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-chatwoot-access-token

# Demo Mode
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_MODE=false
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_AUTH_DEBUG=false

# Application
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://app.smarterbot.cl
NODE_ENV=production
